# ── Crypto custody (Phase 1)
# 32-byte key for AES-256-GCM encryption of the BIP-39 master seed.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# TODO: migrate to AWS KMS (MASTER_SEED_KMS_KEY_ID) before mainnet.
